                                "example_id": "2e37462b-4fa0-4f3a-89f0-e7fe4a154639",
                                "sense_id": "eef5ce1a-fae9-39ec-9fde-eed2c32cac9c",
                                "text": "The acid is decomposed by strong hydrochloric acid at 210°, yielding xylylic acid and metaxylene. Xylylic acid is also produced when it is fused with potash."
